{"words": [{"text": "وَجَعَلُوا۟", "translation": "And they make"}, {"text": "لِلَّهِ", "translation": "with Allah"}, {"text": "شُرَكَآءَ", "translation": "partners "}, {"text": "ٱلْجِنَّ", "translation": "jinn"}, {"text": "وَخَلَقَهُمْ ۖ", "translation": "though He has created them"}, {"text": "وَخَرَقُوا۟", "translation": "and they falsely attribute"}, {"text": "لَهُۥ", "translation": "to Him"}, {"text": "بَنِينَ", "translation": "sons"}, {"text": "وَبَنَـٰتٍۭ", "translation": "and daughters"}, {"text": "بِغَيْرِ", "translation": "without"}, {"text": "عِلْمٍۢ ۚ", "translation": "knowledge"}, {"text": "سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥ", "translation": "Glorified is He"}, {"text": "وَتَعَـٰلَىٰ", "translation": "and Exalted"}, {"text": "عَمَّا", "translation": "above what"}, {"text": "يَصِفُونَ", "translation": "they attribute"}], "sahih": "But they have attributed to Allāh partners - the jinn, while He has created them - and have fabricated for Him sons and daughters without knowledge. Exalted is He and high above what they describe."}